cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - name: RakTikoo
title: "stranger-suite: test whether your README works for someone who has never seen your project"
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-11-19
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/stranger-suite"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/stranger-suite"
abstract: >-
  Tests the instructions, not the code. Fresh-Eyes follows a project's
  README exactly, in a sandbox, and reports the exact step where a real new
  user would have given up. Stranger API checks whether an AI agent can do
  real work from API documentation alone.
keywords:
  - documentation testing
  - README
  - API documentation
  - agents
  - usability
